
# Cortex runtime state (memory + RAG index, regenerable)
.cortex/

# Security-review artifacts: kept on this machine, never committed or pushed.
# The pre-push hook (work/git-hooks/pre-push) enforces the push side.
*audit*
*security*

# The September security review's write-ups and patch scripts: these were
# once pushed by accident and have been scrubbed from the history. They stay
# local from now on; the pre-push hook names them too, so a stale index or
# an amended commit cannot bring them back.
task-state-*
issue-draft.md
pr-draft.md
patch-tm*.py
case-test*.sh
min-test.sh
